# The tafsir payloads are generated and are single-line JSON by design (about
# 67 MB across 114 files). GitHub hides over-long lines in diffs, so they
# render as blank and look as though nothing was pushed. Marking them makes
# that explicit instead of alarming.
data/tafsir_*.json -diff linguist-generated
data/chapter_*.js linguist-generated

# The published pairing is generated from the hand-written sources in
# tools/pairs/authored/, so it is marked as generated too. The sources
# themselves are ordinary hand-written files and are not marked.
data/pairs_*.json -diff linguist-generated
